# Trimmed to what the build context actually needs. Nothing here changes
# which files land in the image -- the Dockerfile's COPY lines already name
# those explicitly -- this only stops an 8MB .pbix sample or a checked-out
# .git history from being sent to the Docker daemon on every build.
.git
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/dist-embedded
frontend/node_modules
data/models/*.pbix
data/samples
tests
docs
*.md
!README.md
